    "data": [
        {
            "title": "最大股東表態支持，Reliance Worldwide股價飆升逾12%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"摩根士丹利尋求出售30億美元貸款以支持皇家加勒比收購案\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03b12eb72923178b43fc9f2bbf5726ab509d08606584f5b99e9fc93014fbdf9f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA8400B_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">摩根士丹利尋求出售30億美元貸款以支持皇家加勒比收購案</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 澳洲上市公司Reliance Worldwide（ASX：RWC）股價週二大幅上漲，此前其最大股東AustralianSuper宣布，計劃投票支持布魯克菲爾德（Brookfield，TSX：BN）以25億美元收購這家澳洲管道產品製造商的提案。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">AustralianSuper截至2024年11月20日持有Reliance Worldwide約18.49%的股份，該基金表示，在沒有更優收購方案出現的情況下，將支持此次安排計劃（scheme of arrangement）。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-133bc118-b402-31d2-8a9c-d28e2361961f-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在格林威治標準時間00:26，在悉尼上市的Reliance Worldwide股價上漲12%，報A$5.07。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">布魯克菲爾德資本合夥公司（Brookfield Capital Partners）於今年9月達成協議，以每股3.38美元的現金價格收購Reliance Worldwide全部流通股，對應股權價值約25.3億美元，企業價值約29億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次收購協議是在布魯克菲爾德多次接觸之後達成的，協議中亦設有「議價期」（go-shop period），允許Reliance Worldwide在此期間尋求其他競爭性收購方案。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">AustralianSuper的支持，對於這項計劃於12月2日召開股東大會表決的收購案而言，無疑是一大重要利好。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A1%E6%9D%B1%E8%A1%A8%E6%85%8B%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81-reliance-worldwide%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E9%A3%86%E5%8D%87%E9%80%BE12-013045135.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 09:33:18",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "理財葉師傅｜港股逐步收復失地 短線有機會反彈｜Gary Sir",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ad375596086210c839e789b0583686e7a298730dac5581aedf5313eec29ecfda/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbossmind_356%2F3ede4d8a6ed6094954c1dc01785dec9b.png\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">港股周一曾跌穿22,000點，最多跌412點，但其後逐步收復跌幅，短線有機會再有反彈。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">聯想（992）周一反彈超過7%。聯想近期的下跌動力已經減弱，但未重新轉強，現時正處調整期，反彈動能未算太強，故宜先作觀察才出手。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">阿里（9988）股價仍未有太大起息。AI指標顯示，阿里暫會繼續尋底，向下能量仍較大。小米（1810）走勢則相對較好，股價正處橫行調整，但要確認升勢須要升穿30.5元。投資者也可考慮沽出行使價24元的認沽期權，搏在更低位接貨。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-9b1b99ef-3d27-320e-95e1-379405a1cf0e-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">舜宇光學（2382）周一回升超過6%。不過，該股反彈的能量不足，有機會反彈後再跌或先作橫行。投資者應待該股升穿65元確認具向上動能才追入。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">黃金上周五曾跌至每盎司3,502美元，周一亞洲時段反彈回每盎司3,600美元。金價現價具吸納價值，可作較長時間的持倉，長揸應考慮實金ETF，而非金礦股。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Gary Sir 資深投資者</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>註：專欄作家言論不代表本網立場</strong></p><a class=\"mb-module-gap\" data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"img\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://signup.hkiei.com/garysir_bossmind\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"1102\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/934c2b4d8643d043a9cd9320926a3f08e37a7ef136ee866a609dec21c7543cd6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbossmind_356%2Ffcf26d239dea6798089bf1250a6e7e2d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></a></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%90%86%E8%B2%A1%E8%91%89%E5%B8%AB%E5%82%85-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%BE%A9%E5%A4%B1%E5%9C%B0-%E7%9F%AD%E7%B7%9A%E6%9C%89%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83%E5%8F%8D%E5%BD%88-gary-sir-003000262.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 08:31:19",
